  {
   "text": "This is today's Item Shop for October 31st.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 2.655
  },
  {
   "text": "Three things before you spend a single V-Buck!",
   "t0": 2.785,
   "t1": 4.79
  },
  {
   "text": "The Five Nights at Freddy's Bundle:",
   "t0": 5.01,
   "t1": 6.455
  },
  {
   "text": "4,500 V-Bucks, instead of 11,000.",
   "t0": 6.565,
   "t1": 9.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Commando and Shadow Ops are in the shop.",
   "t0": 9.61,
   "t1": 11.42
  },
  {
   "text": "Both from Chapter 1, Season 1.",
   "t0": 11.53,
   "t1": 13.29
  },
  {
   "text": "And 28 skins are on their last day, twelve of them Rare.",
   "t0": 13.55,
   "t1": 16.286
  },
  {
   "text": "Buying anything today?",
   "t0": 16.587,
   "t1": 17.826
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 17.887,
   "t1": 20.666
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you for watching! Follow for more daily content.",
   "t0": 20.966,
   "t1": 23.449
  }
